msgid "\"My dear Mr. Bennet,\" said his lady to him one day, \"have you heard that Netherfield Park is let at last?\" Mr. Bennet replied that he had not. \"But it is,\" returned she; \"for Mrs. Long has just been here, and she told me all about it.\" Mr. Bennet made no answer."
msgstr "\"Suamiku Mr. Bennet yang baik,\" kata istrinya suatu hari, \"sudahkah Anda mendengar bahwa Netherfield Park akhirnya disewakan?\" Mr. Bennet menjawab belum. \"Tapi memang sudah,\" balasnya; \"karena Mrs. Long baru saja dari sini, dan menceritakan semuanya kepadaku.\" Mr. Bennet tidak menjawab."

